catflow 0.8
1. Read Text   book.txt
2. Split       chunk_size=2000
3. <each summarize_section>
     1. Summarize   (input:1)   Ministral 3B; "one paragraph"
4. Summarize   Qwen3 8B; "One page, from these section summaries"
5. Save Text   book-summary.md

models:
  Ministral 3B = mlx-community/Ministral-3-3B-Instruct-2512-4bit
  Qwen3 8B     = mlx-community/Qwen3-8B-4bit
